    "title": "Colorado police officer killed in shooting, Lakewood police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Parker Gordon ,\n1 hours ago\nLAKEWOOD, Colo. ( KDVR ) -- One Colorado police agent was killed in a shooting in Lakewood on Thursday night, the local department confirmed. Three other agents were also wounded.\nThe shooting happened near the corner of West Colfax Avenue and Wadsworth Boulevard. Police say that an agent pursued the suspect of a hit-and-run who was spotted boarding a bus in the area.\nThe male suspect then opened fire at police, Lakewood Police Department says. He was also killed in the incident.\nThe four agents were injured in the shooting, as was one civilian.\nThis is a developing story.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WFXRtv.\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
